ster. Intertwine their stories and bring the ceremony to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/5a7a7af7b3e3635715718695f7fcc8de.poster.avif?t=1747755999\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/5a7a7af7b3e3635715718695f7fcc8de.webm?t=1747755999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/5a7a7af7b3e3635715718695f7fcc8de.mp4?t=1747755999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each character has their own style.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay evolves depending on who is being played, ranging from slow-paced exploration to having a literal gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/093d543887a1cb9d44de081451832e42.poster.avif?t=1747755999\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/093d543887a1cb9d44de081451832e42.webm?t=1747755999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/093d543887a1cb9d44de081451832e42.mp4?t=1747755999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reveal the horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recall long-forgotten events from a distant reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
